e reader 'to also return revision' — not bucket/decision provenance.","sidecar.py:408-410 `surfaced = list(best_payload.get('blocking')...) + list(best_payload.get('advisory')...)` — the union erases which bucket each item came from.","sidecar.py:366-368 documents `code_review_result_v1` stores findings in SEPARATE blocking/advisory/coaching buckets with 'no per-finding decision', so there is no `decision` field on a prior item to read."],"finding":"The posture clamp consumes `standing.origin_decision`, but the reader it relies on flattens the prior payload's blocking+advisory buckets into one list with no per-finding decision, so the plan never defines where `origin_decision`'s value comes from.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fb2c4a84c333baac7","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach → 'Posture clamp' bullet and 'State — one rule per value' (standing sub-object); src/rebar/llm/code_review/sidecar.py:408-410 and :366-368","norm_id":"n648f2f463d6783d4","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A prior advisory-bucket finding is carried as still-present; the clamp must limit it to 'advisory' but has no field to read the origin decision from, defaulting undefined.","A prior blocking finding is carried; without preserved provenance the clamp cannot distinguish it from an advisory, so the posture bound is unspecified."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Extend latest_code_review_result to tag each surfaced item with its origin bucket ('block'|'advisory') alongside the new `revision`, and have standing_items copy that into standing.origin_decision so the clamp has a defined value.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_foll